codex
All six write branches store the full value before the guard. The five non-CONF fields have only readback consumers; CONF also feeds the PCI bus selector, which uses bit 0. The sibling registers have explicit implementation TODOs, so their permissiveness supports consistency but does not establish hardware correctness. I’m checking the other write-handling patterns and the remaining termination paths.

